          "instruction": "Rest the batter \u2014 this is what makes them tender.",
          "duration_seconds": 1800
        },
        {
          "instruction": "Fry in a buttered pan until the edges set and the bubbles hold.",
          "temperature_celsius": 180
        }
      ]
    },
